n style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;: Orange stands for enthusiasm and creativity. In the role of a freight forwarder, who manages shipping and transportation, this color represents the creative problem-solving and active approach to logistics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Quality and Safety - Gray (#808080)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;: Gray represents neutrality and balance. In a quality and safety department, which ensures standards are met, this color reflects the objective and balanced approach to maintaining quality and safety.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;■&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Security Service - Black (#000000)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;: Black symbolizes authority and protection. In a security service role, where safeguarding people and assets is essential, this color represents the authoritative and protective nature of the department.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Tactical Buyers - Light Blue (#87CEEB): Light blue represents clarity and precision, which aligns with the need for tactical buyers to make clear and precise purchasing decisions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Procurement Specialist - Gold (#FFD700): Gold symbolizes expertise and value, reflecting the specialized knowledge and the value procurement specialists bring to the procurement process.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Material Planner - Lavender (#E6E6FA): Lavender represents balance and planning, which is essential for material planners who need to ensure a balanced and well-structured approach to inventory management.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;MRP Head - Dark Green (#006400): Dark green stands for stability and control, reflecting the MRP head&#39;s responsibility for managing and controlling the materials required for production.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Procurement Head - Navy Blue (#000080): Navy blue represents trust and depth, reflecting the trust and authority placed in the procurement head&#39;s role in overseeing the entire procurement department.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=0;spacing=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBorderColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;horizontal=1;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
