        <mxCell id="FdTnytR_WRJY2KzvcyKx-26" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;The sales manager has to decide to accept or reject cancellation considering all the factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;If accepted, these material once received and stocked will be tagged as SM and will be offered in Special Sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot; color=&quot;#ff0000&quot;&gt;Any loss will be attributed to this order. If sold, this loss or provision will be reversed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFF5;strokeColor=#4169E1;strokeWidth=2;spacingLeft=-27;align=left;flipV=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=0;spacing=1;labelBorderColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
