        <mxCell id="Ru7CVLNHCat8ClbN-CE9-22" value="&lt;b&gt;Evaluate as per the criteria&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;- Ability to operate independently and autonomously.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Technical capability and competence in relevant skills, systems, or technologies&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Compliance with applicable standards, regulations, and internal policies&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Commercial evaluation, including pricing and cost transparency&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Payment terms and financial conditions&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Delivery lead time, including the ability to meet required timelines&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Delivery terms and responsibilities&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;- Any applicable penalty or liquidated damages clauses&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Mandatory document:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Terms and conditions applicable to installers&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Terms and conditions applicable to labour agents and contractors&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=dataStorage;fixedSize=1;align=left;strokeColor=default;size=0;spacing=2;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFFFEe;spacingTop=-6;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;strokeWidth=0.2;dashed=1;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBorderColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;horizontal=1;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#000000;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
