        <mxCell id="8NcwU-GYVxepkZUVuLv_-5" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Initiation:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Contract/LPO Review (NOT SIGNED YET):&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure received draft contracts and LPOs are reviewed promptly.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales to address any necessary changes or clarifications.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Sales to ensure alignment with customer expectations.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Order Booking initiating OA/OC:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Customer service initiates the order booking process promptly upon finalization of contract terms.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Facilitate the issuance of Order Acknowledgments (OA) or Order Confirmations (OC) in accordance with the finalized agreements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure smooth communication between Sales and Customer Service for seamless transition and accurate documentation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Sales-Project HO:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Facilitate the handover process from Sales to the project team.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure all necessary project documentation and history are consolidated and transferred effectively.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Sales to clarify any project-specific requirements or expectations during handover.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;BG -Invoicing:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Initiate processes for advance payments or bank guarantee as required.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Finance to ensure timely invoicing aligned with project milestones.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitor and track invoicing to ensure accuracy and compliance with payment terms.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Planning:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Internal Kick off:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Organize an internal kickoff meeting involving relevant technical teams.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Develop engineering plans and project management plans covering scope, time, risk, communication, procurement, cost, quality, health, safety, and environmental considerations.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure alignment of plans with project objectives and customer requirements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stage 1: Review and validate Booking Package:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Conduct thorough review and validation of the booking package to ensure accuracy and completeness.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with relevant stakeholders to address any discrepancies or issues identified during the review process.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Develop Project Management Plan (SCOPE plan.., TIME, RISK , COMMUNICATION, PROCUREMENT, COST, QUALITY, HSE):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Develop a comprehensive project management plan encompassing all relevant aspects such as scope, time, risk, communication, procurement, cost, quality, and health, safety, and environmental considerations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure stakeholder alignment and approval of the project management plan.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stage 2: Engineering Approvals:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Facilitate the approval process for engineering plans and designs.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with technical specifications and regulatory requirements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with engineering teams to address any required modifications or revisions.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Logistics Planning:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Develop logistics plans to support project execution and delivery.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with logistics and supply chain teams to ensure timely and efficient transportation of materials and equipment.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Mitigate logistical risks and optimize resource utilization.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Execution:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Customer Kick Off:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Conduct a kickoff meeting with the customer to establish project expectations and objectives.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Communicate project milestones, deliverables, and timelines.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Address any customer concerns or queries to ensure alignment and satisfaction.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Design/Product Finalization:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Facilitate the finalization of designs or products in collaboration with relevant stakeholders.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to project requirements and specifications.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate design reviews and approvals as necessary.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Order to Factories:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Initiate orders to factories for manufacturing or production activities.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with production teams to ensure timely fulfillment of orders.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitor production progress and address any issues or delays proactively.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Order Tracking:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Implement systems for tracking orders throughout the production and delivery process.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitor order status and progress to ensure on-time delivery.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Communicate any deviations or delays to relevant stakeholders and implement corrective actions as needed.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Raw Materials Preparation:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate procurement and preparation of raw materials as per project requirements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure availability of materials to support project execution timelines.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitor inventory levels and address any supply chain disruptions.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;Installation/Subcontractor Management:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Manage installation activities or subcontractors involved in project execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to project plans and specifications.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitor subcontractor performance and address any issues or deviations from requirements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Control:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Project Plan Review and Control:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Regularly review and update the project management plan to reflect progress and changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Monitor project performance against established milestones and targets.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Implement corrective actions to address deviations and mitigate risks.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Change Management:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Establish a formal process for managing changes to project scope, schedule, or requirements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Assess change requests for impacts on project objectives and stakeholders.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Obtain approvals and implement changes in a controlled manner.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Billing and Invoicing:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Continuously monitor project milestones and deliverables for invoicing purposes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Ensure accurate and timely billing aligned with contractual agreements.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Finance to address any invoicing discrepancies or issues.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Closing Out:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Obtain Project Completion: Final Docs Submission, Inspections, Snags, Signoff:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Complete all project deliverables and documentation as per contractual requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Conduct final inspections and address any outstanding issues or snags.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Obtain formal signoff and approval from the customer to close out the project.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Financial Closure: Final Invoice, Warranty Submission, Internal Closeout, and HO for Retention Collection:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Issue final invoices and reconcile project finances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Submit warranty documentation as applicable.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Conduct internal closeout procedures, including archiving project documentation and finalizing financial accounts.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Finance to collect any retention amounts due.&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lesson Learned, Areas of Improvements:&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Conduct a post-project review to identify lessons learned and areas for improvement.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Document key findings and recommendations for future projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Share insights with relevant stakeholders to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;" parent="1" vertex="1">
